      "raw_text": "volumetric attacks that can render critical e.g., 3.5 Tbps [ 1 6 financial institutions, universities, and local attack signatures to separate attack from e.g., number of distinct sources). e.g., changing attack e.g., AT&T) or CDNs ( e.g., Cloudflare) but e.g., small- or medium-sized 9 monitoring for attack signatures on only a few e.g., upstream cloud- or service-providers [ 10 11 12 13 14 15 20 24 observed IP addresses in irrespec- 28",
